  "description": "<h3 style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"340\" data-start=\"286\">🖤 Welcome to the Nurse Couture Affiliate Portal</h3>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"342\">Thank you for joining the <strong data-end=\"404\" data-start=\"368\">Nurse Couture Affiliate Program!</strong> We&rsquo;re so excited to have you representing a brand created to uplift, empower, and style the healthcare community. You&rsquo;re now officially part of something chic, powerful, and purpose-driven. Let&rsquo;s grow together!</p>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"620\" data-start=\"617\">\r\n<h4 style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"660\" data-start=\"622\">👩🏽&zwj;⚕️ <strong data-end=\"658\" data-start=\"635\">Brand Introduction:</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"661\"><strong data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"661\">Nurse Couture</strong> is a nurse-owned lifestyle brand built on 20+ years of clinical experience. We offer both <strong data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"787\">affordable and premium scrubs</strong>, off-duty wear, and accessories made to match the dynamic lifestyle of healthcare professionals.</p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"1047\" data-start=\"927\">We don't just sell clothing&mdash;we celebrate healthcare professionals. Every shift, every hustle, every step of the journey.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"1049\">\r\n<h4 style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1054\">🛍️ <strong data-end=\"1087\" data-start=\"1063\">Product Description:</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"1185\" data-start=\"1090\">We offer curated collections designed with comfort, fashion, and real-world function in mind:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"1607\" data-start=\"1187\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1279\" data-start=\"1187\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1279\" data-start=\"1189\"><strong data-end=\"1213\" data-start=\"1189\">The Stylish Standard</strong> &ndash; Affordable luxury for everyday glam and sporty-chic workwear.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1396\" data-start=\"1280\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1396\" data-start=\"1282\"><strong data-end=\"1305\" data-start=\"1282\">The Luxe Collection</strong> &ndash; Made in Turkey with Italian fabrics; elevated, timeless pieces with premium packaging.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1522\" data-start=\"1397\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1522\" data-start=\"1399\"><strong data-end=\"1426\" data-start=\"1399\">The Off-Duty Collection</strong> &ndash; Loungewear, pajamas, and travel-ready essentials for self-care days and nurse life balance.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1607\" data-start=\"1523\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1607\" data-start=\"1525\"><strong data-end=\"1548\" data-start=\"1525\">Everyday Essentials</strong> &ndash; Drinkware, accessories, and lifestyle tools coming soon!</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"1612\" data-start=\"1609\">\r\n<h4 style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"1655\" data-start=\"1614\">🌟 <strong data-end=\"1653\" data-start=\"1622\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h4>\r\n<ul style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"2200\" data-start=\"1656\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1752\" data-start=\"1656\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1752\" data-start=\"1658\">Nurse owned and operated: built from experience, for real-life clinicians.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1905\" data-start=\"1753\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1905\" data-start=\"1755\">Four thoughtfully curated collections that suit every aspect of a healthcare professional&rsquo;s lifestyle: on-duty, off-duty, and everything in between.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2016\" data-start=\"1906\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2016\" data-start=\"1908\">Functional meets fashionable: wrinkle-resistant, stretchy, breathable fabrics that work as hard as you do.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2121\" data-start=\"2017\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2121\" data-start=\"2019\">A vibrant and supportive community: Nearly 20k members in the <strong data-end=\"2106\" data-start=\"2081\">Nurse Couture Society</strong> and growing.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2200\" data-start=\"2122\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2200\" data-start=\"2124\">Beautiful branding, eco-friendly packaging, and customer-centered service.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"2205\" data-start=\"2202\">\r\n<h4 style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"2235\" data-start=\"2207\">💰 <strong data-end=\"2233\" data-start=\"2215\">Payment Terms:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"2493\" data-start=\"2236\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2298\" data-start=\"2236\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2298\" data-start=\"2238\"><strong data-end=\"2253\" data-start=\"2238\">Commission:</strong> 10% on every sale using your referral link</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2493\" data-start=\"2431\">\r\n<p data-end=\"2493\" data-start=\"2433\">Track everything from your affiliate dashboard in real-time!</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"2498\" data-start=\"2495\">\r\n<h4 style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"2533\" data-start=\"2500\">🛠️ <strong data-end=\"2531\" data-start=\"2509\">Other Information:</strong></h4>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"2814\" data-start=\"2534\">We&rsquo;re so excited to launch this affiliate program&mdash;but full transparency: <span style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;\">it&rsquo;s new! </span>We&rsquo;re still learning, testing, and improving the process. If you experience any glitches, delays, or have feedback, don&rsquo;t hesitate to reach out. Your input is helping us build something great! 🖤</p>\r\n<p style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"2960\" data-start=\"2816\">📧 <strong data-end=\"2830\" data-start=\"2819\">Contact</strong>: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-end=\"2857\" data-start=\"2832\">info@shopnursecouture.com or 800-209-5950</a><br data-end=\"2860\" data-start=\"2857\">📲 <strong data-end=\"2873\" data-start=\"2863\">Tag Us</strong>: @shopnursecouture<br data-end=\"2895\" data-start=\"2892\">📢 <strong data-end=\"2914\" data-start=\"2898\">Use Hashtags</strong>: <strong data-end=\"2933\" data-start=\"2916\">#nursecouture</strong> | <strong data-end=\"2960\" data-start=\"2936\">#nursecouturesociety</strong></p>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration-line: none;\" data-end=\"2965\" data-start=\"2962\">",
